                <mxCell id="HB1" value="expandGroupIfNeeded(rowView, rowObj, pkg)&lt;br&gt;• return if kill-switch disable_headsup_hooks_enabled&lt;br&gt;• return if getRowChildCount()==0 (defer to addNotification)&lt;br&gt;• aeIsGroup = true&lt;br&gt;• parent not expanded → setUserExpanded(true,true), fallback click&lt;br&gt;• every child → collapseChildNoAnim, fallback strict arrow click&lt;br&gt;idempotent: safe to re-enter from setHeadsUp re-fires" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
