                <mxCell id="H9" value="&lt;b&gt;[9] OplusHeadsUpTouchHelper.onInterceptTouchEvent(MotionEvent)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;com.oplus.systemui.notification.headsup.windowframe.*&lt;br&gt;afterHook — passive swipe-direction tracking&lt;br&gt;ACTION_DOWN → f1DownStartY, reset flags&lt;br&gt;ACTION_MOVE (result==true) &amp;&amp; dy &amp;gt; 10 →&lt;br&gt;   f1IsDownwardSwipe = true, f1SwipeTime = now,&lt;br&gt;   f1CurrentRow = getMTouchingHeadsUpView()&lt;br&gt;gate: disable_headsup_popup_enabled" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
