                <mxCell id="H10" value="&lt;b&gt;[10] StatusBarNotificationActivityStarter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;hookAllMethods beforeHook on&lt;br&gt;  • onNotificationClicked(...)&lt;br&gt;  • startNotificationIntent(...)&lt;br&gt;if f1IsDownwardSwipe &amp;&amp; age &amp;lt; 2000 ms:&lt;br&gt;  param.result = null   ← blocks app / mini-window launch&lt;br&gt;  toggleHeadsUpExpandState(row)   (once, f1HasToggled)&lt;br&gt;row resolution: args[1] → arg by class name → f1CurrentRow" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
