                <mxCell id="H11" value="&lt;b&gt;[11] com.android.internal.widget.MessagingTextMessage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;.setMaxDisplayedLines(int) — beforeHook&lt;br&gt;called by MessagingLinearLayout.onMeasure with Integer.MAX_VALUE&lt;br&gt;gates: expand_headsup_enabled ON + kill-switch OFF&lt;br&gt;maxLines = getIntPref(&quot;headsup_max_lines&quot;, 5); 0 = unlimited&lt;br&gt;if args[0] &amp;gt; maxLines → args[0] = maxLines" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
